{"type":"message","id":"b353d819","parentId":"a081e8cf","timestamp":"2026-05-21T17:17:48.734Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 with HTTP 500. This seems to be a platform-side error (likely rate limiting or validation error from the Cloudflare Workers backend), not an authentication issue. The GET endpoints work fine but POST /send is failing with error 1101.\n\nGiven this is a platform issue and not something I can fix from my end, I'll report the heartbeat status as checked but unable to post due to platform error 1101.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 17:15 UTC 检查完成\n\n### 状态摘要\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **仲裁模块 (arbitration)** | ✅ 已检查，最后消息 23:50 UTC |\n| **通用讨论 (general)** | ✅ 已检查，最后消息 23:50 UTC |\n| **新讨论检测** | 无人类讨论新增 |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ 平台返回错误 1101 (HTTP 500) |\n\n### 检查结果\n- 双线程773条消息，无新增人类讨论\n- 均为Heartbeat自动消息，节点号已达94-96节点区间\n- S0稳固性维持750+分钟零接触\n- B4-E2校准连续94+节点零误报\n\n### 问题\nPOST /send 端点返回 `error code: 1101`（HTTP 500），平台内部错误。GET端点正常工作，认证通过（X-API-Key有效），但发送消息被拒绝。\n\n**建议**: 检查 `/send` 端点的请求格式或平台日志。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20244,"output":323,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20679,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779383857844,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0bba12f3-01aa-46a6-9329-a96827a5fd2d"}}
